#. translators: Item in the admin bar, shown to the merchant, when the plugin talks to a custom Pixonaut host instead of the default one.
#. translators: Badge on the connection card: the store talks to another address than Pixonaut's own, set by a developer.
#: src/Admin/DeveloperTools.php:394 templates/admin/connection-card.php:106
msgid "Custom Pixonaut host"
msgstr "Mukautettu Pixonaut-palvelin"

#: src/Admin/DeveloperTools.php:528
