#: src/Fulfilment/CancelTriggers.php:118
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: %1$d of %2$d of \"%3$s\" refunded. Nothing was changed in "
"Pixonaut: only a refund of the whole item cancels it there."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteesta ”%3$s” hyvitettiin %1$d/%2$d. Pixonautissa ei muutettu "
"mitään: vain koko tuotteen hyvitys peruu sen siellä."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/DeliveryChange.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the new address of \"%s\" was not sent: the store is not connected "
