#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. It was ordered under another "
"Pixonaut workspace than the one the store is connected to now."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Se tilattiin eri Pixonaut-"
"työtilassa kuin siinä, johon kauppa on nyt yhdistetty."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:160
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. An earlier attempt sent its "
"printshop order under the cart's reference, so the store cannot tell whether "
"it was placed. Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Aiempi yritys lähetti sen "
"painotilauksen ostoskorin viitteellä, joten kauppa ei voi tietää, tehtiinkö "
"tilaus. Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:178
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line has no design for "
"one of its sides."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Tilausriviltä puuttuu "
"suunnitelma yhdeltä sen puolista."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:231
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was not sent to the printshop. The line does not record how "
"the customer approved the design."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Tilausrivistä ei käy ilmi, "
"miten asiakas hyväksyi suunnitelman."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:375
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a Pixonaut automation already ordered \"%1$s\", as order %2$s. The "
"store took that order on instead of placing another."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: Pixonaut-automaatio tilasi jo tuotteen ”%1$s” tilauksena %2$s. "
"Kauppa otti kyseisen tilauksen hoitoonsa uuden tilauksen tekemisen sijaan."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed when it was placed: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus epäonnistui, kun se tehtiin: %2$s"

#. translators: Fills in %2$s of an order note when the printshop order failed without a reason. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:453 src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:84
msgid "no reason given."
msgstr "syytä ei annettu."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order status Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/Fulfiller.php:468
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was placed with the status "
"\"%2$s\", which the store cannot go on from. Check the order with the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilaus tehtiin tilassa ”%2$s”, josta kauppa "
"ei voi jatkaa. Tarkista tilaus painotalon kanssa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: number of attempts, 3: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:218
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop after %2$d attempts. "
"Pixonaut last answered \"%3$s\". Check the order in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon %2$d yrityksen jälkeen. "
"Pixonaut vastasi viimeksi ”%3$s”. Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa ja yritä "
"sitten uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:316
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop. Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\", and the store could not schedule another attempt. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon. Pixonaut vastasi ”%2$s”, "
"eikä kauppa voinut ajastaa uutta yritystä. Yritä tuotteen lähettämistä "
"uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:346
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. The Pixonaut sandbox no longer knows its "
"design, print or order (\"%2$s\"); this happens when the sandbox's data was "
"reset. Place the item again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonautin sandbox ei enää tunne sen "
"suunnitelmaa, painotiedostoa tai tilausta (”%2$s”); näin käy, kun sandboxin "
"tiedot on nollattu. Tilaa tuote uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: the Pixonaut order the design already has, 4: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:355
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\": its "
"design already has the Pixonaut order %3$s. %4$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonaut hylkäsi sen koodilla ”%2$s”: "
"sen suunnitelmalla on jo Pixonaut-tilaus %3$s. %4$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:364
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\". %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” vaatii toimia. Pixonaut hylkäsi sen koodilla ”%2$s”. "
"%3$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order's status in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is now \"%2$s\" in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilauksen tila Pixonautissa on nyt ”%2$s”."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:495
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" could not be sent again: the store could not schedule it. "
"Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei voitu lähettää uudelleen: kauppa ei voinut "
"ajastaa sitä. Yritä tuotteen lähettämistä uudelleen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:505
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" will be sent to the printshop again."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” lähetetään painotaloon uudelleen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:596 src/Fulfilment/OrderSubmitted.php:177
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” lähetettiin painotaloon uudelleen tilauksena %2$s."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id, 3: its status.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:608
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s, which is "
"\"%3$s\"."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%1$s” lähetettiin painotaloon uudelleen tilauksena %2$s, "
"jonka tila on ”%3$s”."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:638
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop has the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: painotalolla on tuotteen ”%1$s” tilaus. %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:664
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop does not have the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: painotalolla ei ole tuotteen ”%1$s” tilausta. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:686 src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:375
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderCancelled.php:73
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was cancelled."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus peruttiin."

#. translators: Reason in an order note when a merchant rehearses a failed printshop order in the Pixonaut sandbox.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:706
msgid "Rehearsed in the Pixonaut sandbox."
msgstr "Harjoiteltu Pixonautin sandboxissa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why Pixonaut refused, a full sentence or two.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:741
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop again. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%1$s” ei lähetetty painotaloon uudelleen. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is not cancelled yet: the store could not schedule it. It "
"is not sent to the printshop meanwhile. Update the order to try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotetta ”%s” ei ole vielä peruttu: kauppa ei voinut ajastaa sitä. "
"Sitä ei sillä välin lähetetä painotaloon. Yritä uudelleen päivittämällä "
"tilaus."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:265
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a design of \"%1$s\" could not be rejected in Pixonaut, which "
"answered \"%2$s\". It stays unapproved there, so it is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” suunnitelmaa ei voitu hylätä Pixonautissa, joka "
"vastasi ”%2$s”. Suunnitelma jää siellä hyväksymättömäksi, joten sitä ei "
"paineta."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled before it was sent to the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” peruttiin ennen kuin se lähetettiin painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" may have a printshop order, which was not cancelled: the "
"store is not connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Check "
"the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteella ”%s” voi olla painotilaus, jota ei peruttu: kauppaa ei "
"ole yhdistetty siihen Pixonaut-työtilaan, jossa se tilattiin. Tarkista "
"tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was not cancelled: the store is not "
"connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Cancel it in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilausta ei peruttu: kauppaa ei ole yhdistetty "
"siihen Pixonaut-työtilaan, jossa se tilattiin. Peru se Pixonautissa."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why the printshop keeps the order.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:392
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was not cancelled: %2$s Ask the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilausta ei peruttu: %2$s Ota yhteyttä "
"painotaloon."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:402
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled. Its printshop order had failed, so there was "
"nothing to stop at the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuote ”%s” peruttiin. Sen painotilaus oli epäonnistunut, joten "
"painotalossa ei ollut mitään pysäytettävää."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: Pixonaut's reason, if it gave one, with a leading space.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:415
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" could not be cancelled: Pixonaut "
"answered \"%2$s\".%3$s Ask the printshop to stop it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%1$s” painotilausta ei voitu perua: Pixonaut vastasi "
"”%2$s”.%3$s Pyydä painotaloa pysäyttämään se."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:531
msgid "the printshop has made it already."
msgstr "painotalo on jo valmistanut sen."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:533
msgid "the printshop has begun it and did not cancel it."
msgstr "painotalo on aloittanut sen eikä perunut sitä."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:535
msgid "its printshop cannot stop orders through Pixonaut."
msgstr "sen painotalo ei voi pysäyttää tilauksia Pixonautin kautta."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:537
msgid "its printshop is no longer connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "sen painotaloa ei ole enää yhdistetty Pixonautiin."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:539
msgid "the printshop cancelled it, but it shipped meanwhile."
msgstr "painotalo perui sen, mutta se ehdittiin sillä välin lähettää."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:541
msgid "the printshop has it."
msgstr "se on painotalolla."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:115
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the printshop the item was sent to: only the printshop of "
"the product's blank can make it. Check the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut hylkäsi painotalon, jolle tuote lähetettiin: vain tuotteen "
"pohjatuotteen painotalo voi valmistaa sen. Tarkista pohjatuote Pixonautissa "
"ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:116
msgid ""
"The printshop that makes the item is disconnected in Pixonaut. Reconnect it "
"in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen valmistavan painotalon yhteys on katkaistu Pixonautissa. Yhdistä se "
"uudelleen Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:117
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has no printshop to make the item: its design is on no blank, and "
"the workspace has no default printshop. Set one in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonautilla ei ole painotaloa tuotteen valmistamiseen: sen suunnitelma ei "
"ole millään pohjatuotteella, eikä työtilalla ole oletuspainotaloa. Aseta "
"sellainen Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:118
msgid ""
"The blank variant the item was bought as is retired in Pixonaut, so the "
"printshop cannot make it. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pohjatuotteen versio, jona tuote ostettiin, on poistettu käytöstä "
"Pixonautissa, joten painotalo ei voi valmistaa sitä. Hyvitä tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:120
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not tell which variant of the blank the item is: the product "
"sells no variant of its blank. Pick its variant on the product, then refund "
"or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ei voinut päätellä, mikä pohjatuotteen versio tuote on: tuotteelle "
"ei ole valittu yhtään sen pohjatuotteen versiota. Valitse versio tuotteen "
"asetuksista ja hyvitä tai peru sitten tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:122
msgid ""
"The item's print is at a size its position on the blank does not print, or "
"larger than the printshop's machine takes. Check the blank's positions and "
"the printshop's machine in Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the "
"item again at a size it prints."
msgstr ""
"Tuotteen painatus on kokoa, jota sen painokohta pohjatuotteessa ei paina, "
"tai suurempi kuin painotalon kone ottaa. Tarkista pohjatuotteen painokohdat "
"ja painotalon kone Pixonautissa ja pyydä sitten asiakasta personoimaan tuote "
"uudelleen koossa, joka voidaan painaa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:123
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine cannot stitch the item's design as it is, "
"for example a photo or a picture of too many colours. Check the design in "
"Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the item again."
msgstr ""
"Painotalon kirjontakone ei pysty kirjomaan tuotteen suunnitelmaa "
"sellaisenaan, esimerkiksi valokuvaa tai kuvaa, jossa on liian monta väriä. "
"Tarkista suunnitelma Pixonautissa ja pyydä sitten asiakasta personoimaan "
"tuote uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:124
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine could not read the item's design. Check "
"the design in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalon kirjontakone ei pystynyt lukemaan tuotteen suunnitelmaa. Tarkista "
"suunnitelma Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:125
msgid ""
"The printshop charges a fee to set up the embroidery, and the fee has not "
"been accepted in Pixonaut. Accept it for the printshop in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo perii maksun kirjonnan valmistelusta, eikä maksua ole hyväksytty "
"Pixonautissa. Hyväksy painotalon maksu Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten "
"uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:126
msgid ""
"The printshop needs a value the blank's variant or placement does not have. "
"Fill it in for the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Painotalo tarvitsee arvon, jota pohjatuotteen versiolla tai painokohdalla ei "
"ole. Täytä se pohjatuotteelle Pixonautissa ja yritä sitten uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:127
msgid ""
"The design already has a printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order; if the item "
"is to be made as well, choose Order again anyway."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmalla on jo Pixonautissa painotilaus, jota tämä tuote ei tehnyt, "
"esimerkiksi studiossa tehty. Tarkista kyseinen tilaus; jos myös tämä tuote "
"valmistetaan, valitse Tilaa silti uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:128
msgid ""
"The design's personal data was erased in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelman henkilötiedot poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei voi enää "
"painaa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:130
msgid "The design changed in Pixonaut since the customer approved it."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma on muuttunut Pixonautissa sen jälkeen, kun asiakas hyväksyi sen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:131
msgid ""
"The design was deleted in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be printed. Check "
"the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma poistettiin Pixonautissa, joten sitä ei voi enää painaa. "
"Tarkista tilaus asiakkaan kanssa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:132
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after it was approved, so it was not sent "
"to the printshop. Check the design before it is printed."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa sen hyväksymisen jälkeen, joten sitä ei "
"lähetetty painotaloon. Tarkista suunnitelma ennen kuin se painetaan."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:133
msgid "Pixonaut no longer accepts the store's key. Reconnect the store."
msgstr "Pixonaut ei enää hyväksy kaupan avainta. Yhdistä kauppa uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:134
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after the customer bought it, so their "
"proof no longer shows it. Check the design with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelmaa muutettiin Pixonautissa sen jälkeen, kun asiakas osti sen, "
"joten asiakkaan vedos ei enää näytä sitä. Tarkista suunnitelma asiakkaan "
"kanssa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:135
msgid ""
"The design was no longer waiting for the customer's approval when the order "
"was paid, for example because it was rejected in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Suunnitelma ei enää odottanut asiakkaan hyväksyntää, kun tilaus maksettiin, "
"esimerkiksi koska se oli hylätty Pixonautissa."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:136
msgid ""
"The customer did not approve the design by the deadline, so it was rejected "
"and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Asiakas ei hyväksynyt suunnitelmaa määräaikaan mennessä, joten se hylättiin "
"eikä sitä paineta. Hyvitä tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:137
msgid ""
"The customer rejected the proof of the design, so it will not be printed. "
"Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Asiakas hylkäsi suunnitelman vedoksen, joten sitä ei paineta. Hyvitä tai "
"peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:139
msgid "Pixonaut could not be reached, or kept failing. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonautiin ei saatu yhteyttä, tai se epäonnistui toistuvasti. Yritä "
"tuotteen lähettämistä uudelleen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:140
msgid "The printshop order failed. Retry it, or cancel the item."
msgstr "Painotilaus epäonnistui. Yritä uudelleen tai peru tuote."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:141
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop received the order. Check with "
"the printshop, then tell Pixonaut whether it has the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ei voi tietää, saiko painotalo tilauksen. Tarkista asia "
"painotalolta ja kerro sitten Pixonautille, onko tilaus painotalolla."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:142
msgid "Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Tarkista tilaus Pixonautissa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:154
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was sent, but its answer was lost, "
"so Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop has it. Check with the "
"printshop, then settle it in the Pixonaut box of this order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilaus lähetettiin, mutta sen vastaus katosi, "
"joten Pixonaut ei voi tietää, onko tilaus painotalolla. Tarkista asia "
"painotalolta ja ratkaise se sitten tämän tilauksen Pixonaut-ruudussa."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderDeliveryChanged.php:121
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the delivery address of the printshop order for \"%s\" was changed "
"in Pixonaut. The address of this order was not changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: tuotteen ”%s” painotilauksen toimitusosoitetta muutettiin "
